Description:
Do you think some animations take too long? This mod speeds them up to take less than a second each, and you can optionally configure the speed for each animation.
<br />
<br />[b][color=#6aa84f]For non-English players, translations are included in the base mod. [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods#translating-the-mods]Contributions are welcome[/url]![/color][/b]
<br />
<br />
<br />[size=6][b]Install[/b][/size][list=1]
<br />[*][url=https://smapi.io]Install the latest version of SMAPI[/url].
<br />[*]Unzip the mod folder into [font=Courier New]Stardew Valley/Mods[/font].
<br />[*]Run the game using SMAPI.
<br />[/list]
<br />
<br />[size=6][b]How to use[/b][/size]
<br />The mod automatically speeds up many animations throughout the game. That includes...
<br />[list]
<br />[*]breaking geodes;
<br />[*]casino slots;
<br />[*]drinking &amp; eating (optionally skip confirm dialogue);
<br />[*]harvesting crops;
<br />[*]milking;
<br />[*]mounting/dismounting horses;
<br />[*]taking the bus;
<br />[*]title menu animations;
<br />[*]and much more.
<br />[/list]
<br />You can use [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098]Generic Mod Config Menu[/url] to choose which animations to speed up in-game. If an animation speed is 1, it'll run at the normal speed.
<br />﻿[img]data:image/png;base64,[/img]
<br />
<br />
<br />[size=6][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]
<br />Compatible with...[list]
<br />[*]Stardew Valley 1.6.15 or later;
<br />[*]Linux, macOS, and Windows;
<br />[*]single-player and multiplayer (see [url=https://github.com/Pathoschild/StardewMods/tree/stable/FastAnimations#compatibility]multiplayer compatibility notes[/url]).
<br />[/list]
<br />Mod conflicts:
<br />[list]
<br />[*]Don't Stop Me Now: tool animations won't be sped up when using that mod.
<br />[/list]
<br />Pairs well with:
<br />[list]
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098]Generic Mod Config Menu[/url] to change animation speeds in-game (even after loading a save).
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/15191]Instant Eat Key[/url] to skip the eating confirmation dialogue while holding a key.﻿ 
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/533]Skip Intro[/url]﻿ to skip the game's launch credits.
<br />[*][url=https://smapi.io/mods#Tool_Charging]Tool Charging[/url]﻿ to use upgraded tool areas more quickly.
<br />[/list]
